msgstr "Réglages"

#: view/settings.php:31
msgid ""
"This screen decides what Fast Index sends to Google and when. Upload your "
"Google key, choose the content to send and save; after that every new post "
"is sent on its own."
msgstr ""
"Cet écran définit ce que Fast Index envoie à Google et quand. Téléversez "
"votre clé Google, choisissez le contenu à envoyer et enregistrez ; ensuite, "
"chaque nouvel article est envoyé automatiquement."

#: view/settings.php:42
msgid ""
"Some of your settings belong to the premium plan. They are kept, but this "
"version does not use them. They are used again when the premium package is "
"installed and its license is active."
msgstr ""
"Certains de vos réglages appartiennent à l’offre Premium. Ils sont "
"conservés, mais cette version ne les utilise pas. Ils sont de nouveau "
"utilisés lorsque le paquet Premium est installé et que sa licence est active."

#: view/settings.php:61
msgid "Switch sending on or off."
msgstr "Activer ou désactiver l’envoi."

#: view/settings.php:101
msgid "Choose when Google is notified."
msgstr "Choisissez quand Google est prévenu."

#: view/settings.php:122
